{
  "bookId": "hero-213110",
  "id": "bond-28573",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28573001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "有没有手办也能骑的摩托车呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "嘛，在这之前，我需要先确认一件事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "手办在M城骑摩托，需要考驾照吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28573005",
              "text": "应该……不用？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28573005",
              "text": "不如问问管理局。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28573004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "啧，麻烦，还是你骑摩托带我兜风吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28573007",
              "text": "可是……我不会骑摩托。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28573006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "很简单，我来教你。很快你就会明白骑摩托就像穿衣吃饭一样容易。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28573009",
              "text": "万一路上遇到行人怎么办？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28573008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "当然要停下来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "只不过有的时候，不是你想停就能马上停下来的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "没办法啊，一直看着前面的话，当然就看不到速度计了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28573013",
              "text": "？？？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28573013",
              "text": "告辞。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28573012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28573013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "喂，我还没有说完，你给我回来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
